# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DENY-ALL ALLOWLIST.
#
# This repo lives inside a working directory that also holds real, confidential
# meeting recordings and transcripts. A conventional "ignore these paths"
# .gitignore is one typo away from leaking a client's audio.
#
# So: ignore everything, then explicitly re-admit source files only.
# If you add a new source file, add it here too or git will not see it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*

# --- source ---
!.gitignore
!README.md
!README.zh-TW.md
!BENCHMARK.md
!LICENSE
!install.sh
!requirements.txt
!config.example.json

!bin/
!bin/*.py
!bin/*.sh
bin/__pycache__/

!templates/
!templates/*.md
!templates/*.docx
!templates/*.template

!docs/
!docs/**

!tests/
!tests/*.py
tests/__pycache__/

# --- never, under any circumstance ---
# (redundant with the deny-all above; kept as a second line of defence)
archive/
inbox/
jobs/
logs/
models/
.uploads/
.venv/
.token
config.json
*.m4a
*.mp3
*.wav
*.mp4
*.json.bak
